\subsubsection*{Recommended Changes}
\label{sec:orge049b8c}
The paper could be improved by extending the evaluation to cover more
datasets and system configurations.

Further comparisons with other current approaches to automated system
monitoring and analysis would help to highlight the suggested method's
advantages.

Additional discussion on scalability and deployment considerations in
large-scale environments will greatly improve the contribution.


